{
  "boardName": "Night Groove",
  "description": "The Timeline demo's night sky with a drum groove under it, both played by one clock.\n\nThe **Show** is a timeline that counts in **beats**: four bars, sixteen beats, looping, at the tempo held in the **Tempo** slot. Its placements arrange sound and picture alike, by name: the hi-hats from the first beat, the `kick` from the second bar, the `snare` from the third and a `fill` in the last two beats; the stars pop in one a beat over the first bar, the rocket launches with the kick, the planet arrives with the snare and the comet crosses with the fill.\n\nEvery frame goes to the **Band** first, then to the **Scene**. Each Band track is a use of **Drum**: a timeline that loops a few beats of its own, with an action wherever the drum is hit, and a Sound that plays when a frame carries one. The Scene draws what the Timeline demo draws, stretched from seconds to beats, and a **moon** that takes the name `kick` too — placed once, the kick is heard and the moon beats with it.\n\nNothing is scheduled: sound and picture are both worked out from the time in each frame, so Pause silences the band and holds the picture together, and turning the tempo speeds up both.",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "drum",
      "name": "Drum",
      "serviceId": "sub-service",
      "description": "One drum on a loop of its own: the hits lie on a timeline of `length` beats, and every frame one falls in plays the drum. It plays while its name is placed and repeats for as long as the placement lasts.",
      "params": {
        "name": "drum",
        "sound": "kick",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "length": 1,
        "hits": [
          {
            "at": 0
          }
        ]
      },
      "state": {
        "pipeline": [
          {
            "serviceId": "hookup.to/service/timeline",
            "instanceId": "loop",
            "serviceName": "Loop",
            "state": {
              "clock": "input",
              "length": "{{param.length}}",
              "loop": true,
              "actions": "{{param.hits}}",
              "placement": "{{param.name}}"
            }
          },
          {
            "serviceId": "hookup.to/service/filter",
            "instanceId": "on-a-hit",
            "serviceName": "On a hit",
            "state": {
              "conditions": [
                "params.actions.length > 0"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "serviceId": "hookup.to/service/sound",
            "instanceId": "sound",
            "serviceName": "Sound",
            "state": {
              "generator": "drums",
              "trigger": "{{param.sound}}",
              "volume": "{{param.volume}}"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pop",
